OTOGAKURE FORBIDDEN TECHNIQUE ARCHIVE
CLASSIFICATION: RESTRICTED — MEDIC CADRE
Scroll Ref: FB-LC-002

SUBJECT: Living Corpse Reincarnation (Fushi Tensei) — Body-Transfer Jutsu

Purpose
The Living Corpse Reincarnation permits the caster to abandon a failing vessel and
transfer their consciousness and chakra network wholesale into a prepared host body.
This is the cornerstone of Lord Orochimaru's pursuit of endless life.

Requirements
- A viable host, physically compatible, subdued or willing.
- A three-year interval minimum between transfers while the vessel is assimilated.
- Full binding of the host's own consciousness before transfer completes; incomplete
  binding permits the host to reject the caster from within.

Procedure (summary)
1. Suppress the target's chakra and immobilize.
2. Cast the transfer sequence; the caster's essence migrates as a white serpentine form.
3. Assimilation period follows — the new body cannot be used at full capacity until the
   network settles.

Standing Note
Host selection is a strategic matter. Bodies bearing a strong kekkei genkai are the
priority acquisition (see kekkei_genkai_collection_log). The Uchiha vessel remains the
designated preferred host pending retrieval.
